{"id":"en_king-without-burma","title":"King Without Burma","titleEn":"King Without Burma","description":"At just twenty-five, Zhan Tianya stands as a Martial God at the height of his powers. Once the young heir of the Zhan household, he alone survived when his clan was wiped out under mysterious circumstances. Seeking answers about who destroyed his family, he answered the Divine Sovereign's call three years earlier and went to Kunlun Mountain, where he fought demons and malevolent spirits and won legendary battlefield honors. The Divine Sovereign wished to hand him the throne, but Zhan Tianya firmly turned down such power struggles and went back to Jiangzhou. Returning after three years, he finds the Zhan estate in ruins, kept going only by Ah Fu, an elderly steward. The land he once swore to defend has become a lawless, war-ravaged zone known as the Southern Golden Triangle. Now he crosses ","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/king-without-burma/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/king-without-burma/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Revenge","Second Chance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnrq0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_king-without-burma_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnrq0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_king-without-burma_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnrq0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_king-without-burma_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dnrq0/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed",